Excerpts derived from BLIS
======================================================================

The two excerpts of the NEON micro kernel in the guide on GEMM (general
matrix-matrix product), gemm/ulmblas-excerpts/ugemm-neon-comment.txt and
gemm/ulmblas-excerpts/ugemm-neon-loop.txt (from the file
ulmblas/level3/ukernel/neon/ugemm.tcc of ulmBLAS), are derived from the
micro kernel bli_dgemm_armv8a_asm_8x6r of BLIS and are distributed under
the license of that file:

